ial alinhado às necessidades atuais.\n\nAgende sua visita e descubra um imóvel que reúne sofisticação, localização privilegiada e um projeto pensado para viver com conforto e exclusividade.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2e0cbd11-05e0-4272-ba30-d5062a40b508.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38608a44-aaf6-4649-8e30-6457f3fe1ae7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c8cbe349-1fa6-47ef-a8bb-29de7116438a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5fa78359-3bd6-45fa-beb1-e728a9644761.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d2f3a806-0c22-487d-aba7-8843639437ec.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e995f59d-249b-4fca-ab38-801bb77f7543.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8e4841e0-c6ad-4981-af9f-dd7edc2e5abc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9d560b45-296a-4c4e-b672-209538ad226f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d0ffb8b-d677-400a-b80a-223665fe3b2e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a9dde778-33f6-413c-aab0-66d76e96faa6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d3a22a5d-5d3b-4a1b-9914-8e02a1ff2d04.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a733d49ea411ee17f8981ce/pilar-homes-images-watermark/03c36df3-1145-4090-87a1-024e03f0e672.jpeg","https://bli